{{Passive skill box|Void Beacon}}

'''Void Beacon''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Occultist]]. It lowers the [[cold resistance|cold]] and [[chaos resistance]] and [[life regeneration]] of nearby enemies.

The radius of the [[aura]] is 60.<ref name="Radius"/>

